---

## 10. Known caveats

1. The helper is intentionally independent. It is not yet threaded into the bus execute-action plan or executor skeleton.
2. The helper does not select routes, services, adapters, or bundles. It validates compatibility for an already-selected route plan.
3. The helper does not check whether artifact paths exist on disk. Artifact layout remains static model-bundle metadata.
4. Future executor integration should decide where this helper sits in the accepted execution chain.

